  "method": "Each run starts a new process in a directory containing the same guest and the specified wrapper. The guest checks that its app-local wrapper is loaded and that each name and ordinal resolve to the same address.",
  "disconnected": "The package transport has no Game OS front panel device on these hosts. Errors and outputs matched with either the package transport or no transport alongside the TuxBox DLL.",
